        <ul class="anu-terminal-list">
          <li><strong>The Linear Split:</strong> Unlike the non-linear, scalar wave dynamics of the Anuhazi Root Code, modern exoteric dialects are hardcoded into an either/or structure. This forces the nervous system to oscillate perpetually between artificial dualities.</li>
          <li><strong>The Grammar of Entropy:</strong> Exoteric syntax fragments reality into subjects acting upon objects. This linguistic separation isolates the observer from the observed, cementing the illusion of a hostile external matrix.</li>
          <li><strong>Loosh Generation Architecture:</strong> By using vocabulary designed strictly around opposites (good/evil, right/wrong, self/other), the False Personality automatically engages in psychological friction, releasing energy that feeds the lower astral grid.</li>
